  "publishedAt": "2026-09-13 23:16:38",
  "releaseNotes": "# AID v2.1.3\n\n## 中文更新说明\n\n### 新增与优化\n\n- Skill Runtime、官方风格及风格分类目录支持未登录访客安全读取公开内容；执行、历史、事件、取消、个人素材和维护接口仍要求登录。\n- 合并资产列表在未登录时仅返回官方素材；登录后按个人素材、官方推荐、官方非推荐的稳定顺序返回，并保持跨分页一致。\n- 剧本 Skill 支持选择业务池内兼容模型，入口模型会继承到写作、审核及其子任务；未指定时继续使用已发布 Skill 默认模型。\n- 模型列表与实际调用统一按精确能力编码优先解析；模型移出业务池前可预览引用并明确指定池内替代模型，已有业务绑定、历史任务、SKU、价格、倍率和启停状态保持不变。\n- 管理后台按需折叠模型能力与业务默认参数，改善模型池能力维护、移出确认和替代模型选择流程。\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复 DeepSeek Flash 普通对话误用实验路径、过期兼容模型名以及空正文后自动切换模型造成重复请求的问题；无有效正文时按失败终态退回本次预冻结积分。\n- 文本结构化输出改为业务显式开启，避免普通对话和 Skill 因提示词出现 JSON 字样而被误切换响应格式；明确要求结构化结果的业务步骤保持原行为。\n- 修复模型池维护把旧生成模式误作结构化能力、同类型多能力模型被错误过滤，以及失效引用阻断安全移出的问题。\n- 修复案例广场卡片未按项目画幅展示、剧本任务历史恢复误报失败及重复消息的问题。\n\n### 数据库与升级说明\n\n- 升级执行可重复运行的 `sql/v2.1.3.sql`：为历史安装环境补齐 `aid_schema_history`，并幂等修正 DeepSeek Flash 的上游模型名和普通聊天路径。\n- Agnes 3.0 Flash 已由 `v2.1.0` 提供，本版本不重复写入其模型数据；不会覆盖模型启停、密钥、网关、倍率、业务池、自定义计费或不可变 Skill 版本。\n- 已在 MySQL 5.7 完成 `v2.1.2` 增量重复执行及 `v1.0.0-beta.1` 全链路连续升级复核；正式渠道最低一键直升版本继续为 `v1.0.0-beta.1`。\n- 升级前请备份数据库、部署配置、证书和用户媒体目录。本版本三端均有公共改动，应同步更新服务端、后台管理端和 Web 用户端。\n\n## English Release Notes\n\n### Added and Improved\n\n- Anonymous users can safely read the public Skill Runtime, official-style, and style-category catalogs. Execution, history, events, cancellation, personal assets, and management operations still require authentication.\n- The merged asset catalog returns official assets only for anonymous users. Authenticated results remain stably ordered as personal, recommended official, then other official assets across page boundaries.\n- Script Skills can select a compatible model from the business pool and inherit that choice through writing, review, and child tasks. Published Skill defaults remain the fallback.\n- Model listings and runtime invocation now resolve exact capability codes first. Removing a model from a business pool provides a read-only reference preview and requires an explicit in-pool replacement when migration is necessary, without changing historical tasks, SKUs, prices, multipliers, or enablement.\n- The admin UI now progressively discloses model capabilities and business defaults, with clearer pool-capability maintenance, removal confirmation, and replacement selection.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed DeepSeek Flash normal chat using an experimental route, an obsolete compatibility model name, and automatic fallback requests after empty content. Empty valid content now reaches a failed terminal state and refunds the current pre-authorization.\n- Structured text output is now enabled explicitly by each business flow, preventing normal chat and Skills from switching response formats merely because a prompt mentions JSON. Workflows that require structured results keep their existing behavior.\n- Fixed legacy generation modes being treated as structured capabilities, multi-capability models being filtered incorrectly, and stale references blocking safe model-pool removal.\n- Fixed case-gallery cards ignoring the project aspect ratio, and fixed restored script tasks showing false failures or duplicate messages.\n\n### Database and Upgrade Notes\n\n- Run the repeatable `sql/v2.1.3.sql` migration. It adds `aid_schema_history` for historical installations and idempotently corrects the DeepSeek Flash upstream model and normal-chat route.\n- Agnes 3.0 Flash was already delivered by `v2.1.0` and is not inserted again. Existing model enablement, credentials, gateways, multipliers, business pools, custom billing, and immutable Skill versions are preserved.\n- MySQL 5.7 verification passed for both repeated `v2.1.2` delta migration and the full continuous chain from `v1.0.0-beta.1`. The stable one-click upgrade floor remains `v1.0.0-beta.1`.\n- Back up the database, deployment configuration, certificates, and user media before upgrading. This release contains public changes in all three applications, so update the server, admin application, and Web client together.",
